    "Siri 用它自己的語言聽你說話，聽不出韓文、日文這類原文名稱。設一個你唸得出來的名字，就能說「Play %@ in NerLan」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siri listens in its own language and can’t hear native titles in Korean, Japanese, and the like. Give the show a name you can pronounce, then say “Play %@ in NerLan”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Siri 聽得懂的說法": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
