    },
    "在區域網路上搜尋 whisperASR 轉錄伺服器（_whisperasr._tcp）。請確認伺服器已啟用 API 服務並開啟區域網路存取，且兩台裝置在同一個 Wi-Fi。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looks for a whisperASR transcription server on the local network (_whisperasr._tcp). Make sure the server has its API enabled and local network access allowed, and that both devices are on the same Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在播放器或單集列表點選逐字稿或 AI 講義圖示來產生內容，就會出現在這裡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the transcript or AI handout icon in the player or episode list to generate content, and it shows up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在目前的單集內前後跳 15 秒。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jump 15 seconds forward or back within the current episode."
