    "與 OpenAI 相容的伺服器網址（到 /v1 為止），用於 /audio/transcriptions。本機伺服器通常不需金鑰。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An OpenAI-compatible server address (up to /v1) serving /audio/transcriptions. Local servers usually need no key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "與 OpenAI 相容的伺服器網址（到 /v1 為止），用於 /chat/completions。講義、翻譯與句子斷句都會使用這個伺服器。\n本機 Ollama 的思考模型（qwen3、deepseek-r1 等）預設會輸出思考過程，開啟「停用思考模式」會傳送 reasoning_effort=none 將其關閉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An OpenAI-compatible server address (up to /v1) serving /chat/completions. Handouts, translation, and sentence splitting all use this server.\nLocal Ollama reasoning models (qwen3, deepseek-r1, and the like) emit their thinking by default; “Disable thinking” sends reasoning_effort=none to turn that off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
