      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐字稿畫面的「翻譯」按鈕會把內容翻譯成這個語言（使用你的 OpenAI 額度，並會同步到 iCloud）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Translate button on the transcript screen renders content into this language (using your OpenAI credit, and synced to iCloud)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐字稿與講義": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcripts & Handouts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個 RSS 沒有可播放的單集": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This RSS feed has no playable episodes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "速度": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連續聆聽天數": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening Streak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選擇 AI 逐字稿與講義要使用的伺服器。「自訂」可指向你自己（通常較便宜或本機）的 OpenAI 相容伺服器。兩組設定都會分別保存，可隨時切換。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose which server powers AI transcripts and handouts. “Custom” can point at your own (often cheaper, or local) OpenAI-compatible server. Both configurations are saved separately, so you can switch any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有節目": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Shows Yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
