      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regenerate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重複次數": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repeat Count"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重複這句": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repeat This Line"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重試": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "金鑰會安全地儲存在裝置的鑰匙圈中。逐字稿與 AI 講義會使用你的 OpenAI 額度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key is stored securely in the device keychain. Transcripts and AI handouts use your own OpenAI credit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟串流快取後，播放過的單集會保留在這裡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on streaming cache and episodes you finish will be kept here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，串流完整播放過的音檔會自動保存，下次播放免再下載（不會顯示在「下載」分頁）。%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, audio you stream all the way through is kept for offline replay, so it never downloads twice (it doesn’t appear in the Downloads tab). %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，最愛、AI 逐字稿與講義、收聽統計與 Podcast 訂閱會備份到你的 Google Drive（隱藏的應用程式資料夾），並與 Android 版 App 互通。可與 iCloud 同步並用。音檔不會同步。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, favorites, AI transcripts and handouts, listening stats, and podcast subscriptions are backed up to your Google Drive (in the hidden app data folder) and shared with the Android app. Can run alongside iCloud sync. Audio is never synced."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，逐字稿與 AI 講義會備份到 iCloud，並同步到你登入相同 Apple ID 的其他裝置（重新安裝後也會自動復原）。音檔不會同步。需登入 iCloud 並開啟 iCloud 雲碟。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, transcripts and AI handouts are backed up to iCloud and synced to your other devices signed in with the same Apple ID (and restored after a reinstall). Audio is never synced. Requires iCloud and iCloud Drive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始聆聽後，這裡會顯示你的使用統計。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start listening and your stats will show up here."
          }
        }
      }
